{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119889","id":4553360618,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD2bE6g","number":119889,"title":"Label with autowrap may overflow horizontally when in a VBoxContainer inside a MarginContainer with maximum size","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-05-30T05:23:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T23:28:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T16:14:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in 4.7 beta 2, 3, 4, has a slightly different, but wrong, behaviour in 4.7 beta 1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nGiven the following structure. Set a maximum size on the margin container or a parent. \n\n> MarginContainer\n> > VBoxContainer\n> > > Label\n\nWhen the Label has autowrap enabled, it does not respect the margins. \n\n<img width=\"176\" height=\"97\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9d59908-dbc0-4464-a568-635d0ddc358e\" />\n\nAfter toggling visible of the margin container or another parent node (either in code or through the editor), the height is increased.\n\n<img width=\"172\" height=\"116\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c716195-e0de-40df-8ce8-7018ad627558\" />\n\nThough the width here may even be too wide? \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n<details open>\n<summary>Code</summary>\n\n```\nvar l := Label.new()\nl.text = \"some longer text here: aaaaaaaaaa\"\nl.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART\n\nvar vb := VBoxContainer.new()\nvb.add_child(l)\n\nvar mc := MarginContainer.new()\nmc.add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_bottom\", 10)\nmc.add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_top\", 10)\nmc.add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_left\", 10)\nmc.add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_right\", 10)\nmc.add_child(vb)\n\nvar p := PanelContainer.new()\nvar sb := StyleBoxFlat.new()\nsb.bg_color = Color.GRAY\np.add_theme_stylebox_override(\"panel\", sb)\n\np.propagate_maximum_size = true\np.custom_maximum_size = Vector2(150, -1)\n\np.add_child(mc)\n\nadd_child(p)\n# Uncommenting these two lines will fix the issue\n#p.visible = false\n#p.visible = true\n```\n</details>\n\nThe `PanelContainer` is not necessary to reproduce the issue but helps to see it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[label-vbox-margin-overflow.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28416832/label-vbox-margin-overflow.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119889/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}